# T05 owns the curated few-shot example store: the dev examples and their
# README are checked in; any other data/examples/ content stays ignored.
# (Ignore the directory contents, not the directory itself, so the two tracked
# files can be re-included.)
data/examples/*
!data/examples/dev_examples.yaml
!data/examples/README.md
outputs/local/
